hadiths[89]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2810","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do darwaze hain jin ki saza duniya mein jald di jati hai: zulm-o-ziyadti aur waldain ki nafarmani."
"2811","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Subah hone se pehle witr parhne mein jaldi karo."
"2812","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chhe cheezon ke aane se pehle neik aamaal mein jaldi karo: bewaqufon ki hukumat, sipahiyon ki kasrat, faislon ka becha jana, khoon ki be-qadri, qata-e-rehmi, aur aise naujawaan jo Quran ko geet bana lenge; wo apne mein se aik ko aage karenge taake wo unhein gana sunaye chahe wo un mein sab se kam samajh wala ho."
"2813","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chhe cheezon se pehle aamaal mein jaldi karo: suraj ka maghrib se tuloo hona, dhuwan, zameen ka janwar, Dajjal, tum mein se har aik ka khaas muamla aur aam muamla."
"2814","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Andheri raat ke tukron jaise fitnon ke aane se pehle neik aamaal mein jaldi karo: aadmi subah momin hoga aur shaam ko kafir, aur shaam ko momin hoga aur subah kafir; un mein se koi apna deen duniya ke thore se saamaan ke ewaz bech dega."
"2815","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sitare ke nikalne se pehle Maghrib ki namaz parhne mein jaldi karo."
"2816","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere sahaba ke liye qatl hi kaafi hai."
"2817","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kiya hi khoob hain paanch cheezein, meezaan mein kitni bhari hain: La ilaha illallah, Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, Allahu Akbar, aur naik beta jo musalman aadmi ka faut ho jaye to wo us par ajr ki ummeed rakhe."
"2818","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jo shakhs mushrikon ke saath un ke mulk mein muqeem rahe, us se zimme ka talluq khatm hai."
"2819","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajj ki neki khana khilana aur achchi guftagu karna hai."
"2820","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bismillahir Rahmanir Raheem; Muhammad ki taraf se jo Abdullah ke bande aur us ke Rasool hain, Herqal azeem-e-Room ki taraf; salam us par jo hidayat ki pairwi kare; amma bad, main tumhein Islam ki dawat deta hun, musalman ho jao salamat rahoge, Allah tumhein tumhara ajr dohra dega; phir agar tum ne munh phera to tum par kashtkaron ka gunah hoga; aur: Ae ehl-e-kitaab, aao aisi baat ki taraf jo hamare aur tumhare darmiyan barabar hai ke ham Allah ke siwa kisi ki ibadat na karein, us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karein, aur ham mein se koi kisi ko Allah ke siwa Rab na banaye; phir agar wo munh pherein to keh do ke gawah raho ke ham musalman hain."
"2821","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bismillahir Rahmanir Raheem; ye wo hai jo Adaa bin Khalid bin Hauza ne Muhammad Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se khareeda: un se aik ghulam ya laundi khareedi is shart par ke na koi bimari hai, na dhoka, na khayanat; musalman ka musalman se sauda aisa hi hota hai."
"2822","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Duniya ki khushkhabri naik khwab hai."
"2823","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Andheron mein masjidon ki taraf paidal chalne walon ko qayamat ke din kaamil noor ki khushkhabri do."
"2824","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ko khushkhabri do ke jo kahe: Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai, us ka koi shareek nahi, to us ke liye jannat wajib ho gayi."
"2825","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ummat ko roshan mustaqbil, deen, bulandi, nusrat aur zameen mein iqtidar ki khushkhabri do; pas un mein se jo aakhirat ka amal duniya ke liye karega, aakhirat mein us ka koi hissa nahi hoga."
"2826","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khadija ko jannat mein moti ke mahal ki khushkhabri do jis mein na shor hoga na takleef."
"2827","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Buthan jannat ke hauzon mein se aik hauz par hai."
"2828","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe ehl-e-Baqee ki taraf bheja gaya taake main un par namaz-e-janaza parhun."
"2829","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main aur qayamat in donon ki tarah qareeb qareeb bheje gaye hain."
"2830","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jawaame-ul-kalim ke saath bheja gaya aur rob ke zariye meri madad ki gayi; aur main soya hua tha ke zameen ke khazanon ki chabiyan layi gayin aur mere haath mein rakh di gayin."
"2831","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main qayamat se pehle talwar ke saath bheja gaya taake Allah taala ¤ akela, bila-shareek, pooja jaye; aur mera rizq mere nezay ke saye tale rakha gaya; aur zillat aur ruswai us par hai jo mere hukm ki mukhalifat kare; aur jo kisi qaum se mushabihat ikhtiyar kare wo unhi mein se hai."
"2832","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main qayamat ki aamad ke zamane mein bheja gaya."
"2833","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main achche akhlaq ki takmeel ke liye bheja gaya."
"2834","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main bani Adam ke behtareen zamano mein se bheja gaya, aik zamane ke baad doosra zamana, yahan tak ke main us zamane mein hua jis mein main hun."
"2835","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Iftar mein jaldi karo aur sehri mein der karo."
"2836","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Balke Allah hi qeematein ghataata aur barhaata hai; aur main ummeed rakhta hun ke Allah se is haal mein milun ke mere zimme kisi ka koi mutalba na ho."
"2837","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri taraf se deen pahuncha do chahe aik aayat ho; aur bani Israel se riwayatein bayan karo, koi harj nahi; aur jo mujh par jaan-boojh kar jhoot bandhe wo aag mein apna thikana bana le."
"2838","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne rishton ko sila-rehmi se tar rakho chahe salam ke saath."
"2839","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Banu Hashim aur Banu Muttalib aik hi cheez hain."
"2840","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Islam ki bunyaad paanch cheezon par rakhi gayi hai: gawahi dena ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain, namaz qaim karna, zakat dena, Baitullah ka hajj karna aur Ramazan ke roze rakhna."
"2841","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke liye us ke subah-sawere mein barkat rakhi gayi hai."
"2842","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Doodh-peete larke ke peshab par paani chhirak diya jaye aur larki ka peshab dhoya jaye."
"2843","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tere liye kharabi ho ae ibn Sumayya, tujhe baghi giroh qatl karega."
"2844","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ghar mein khajoorein na hon us ke rehne wale bhooke hain."
"2845","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jis ghar mein khajoorein na hon wo aise ghar ki tarah hai jis mein khana na ho."
"2846","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ki kitni buri sawari hai ye lafz ke unhon ne kaha."
"2847","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ke liye kitna bura hai ke kahe: main falan falan aayat bhool gaya; balke use bhula diya gaya hai."
"2848","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ke aur shirk aur kufr ke darmiyan farq namaz ka chhorna hai."
"2849","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kufr aur iman ke darmiyan farq namaz ka chhorna hai."
"2850","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har do azanon ke darmiyan namaz hai, jo chahe parhe."
"2851","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har do rakaaton ke darmiyan tehiyya hai."
"2852","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat se pehle harj yaani qatl-o-khoonrezi ke din honge."
"2853","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat se pehle tum aisi qaum se ladoge jin ke joote baalon ke honge, aur wo aag wale hain."
"2854","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat se pehle tum aisi qaum se ladoge jo baalon ke joote pehenti hogi, aur tum aisi qaum se ladoge goya un ke chehre kooti hui dhalen hain."
"2855","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat se pehle andheri raat ke tukron jaise fitne honge."
"2856","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qayamat se pehle maskh, zameen mein dhansna aur patharon ki barish hogi."
"2857","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main jannat mein chal raha tha ke mere saamne aik neher aayi jis ke donon kinare khokhle moti ke gumbad the; maine kaha: Ae Jibreel, ye kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Kausar hai jo Allah ne tumhein ataa ki hai. Phir unhon ne apna haath us ki mitti par maara to us mein se mushk nikli. Phir mere saamne Sidrat-ul-Muntaha buland ki gayi to maine us ke paas zabardast noor dekha."
"2858","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main soya hua tha ke zameen ke khazane laye gaye aur mere haath mein sone ke do kanghan rakhe gaye; ye mujh par bhari lage aur mujhe fikr mein daal diya; to Allah ne meri taraf wahi ki ke inhein phoonk do; maine inhein phoonka to wo ur gaye; maine in ki taabeer un do jhooton se ki jin ke darmiyan main hun: Sanaa wala aur Yamama wala."
"2859","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main soya hua tha ke doodh ka aik pyala laya gaya; maine us mein se piya yahan tak ke main seraabi apne nakhunon mein jaari hoti dekhta tha; phir maine apna bacha hua Umar bin Khattab ko de diya. Sahaba ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, aap ne is ki kiya taabeer ki? Aap ne farmaya: Ilm."
"2860","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main soya hua tha ke maine dekha ke log mere saamne pesh kiye ja rahe hain aur un par qameesein hain; koi seenay tak pahunchti hai aur koi us se neeche tak pahunchti hai; aur mere saamne Umar bin Khattab pesh kiye gaye aur un par qamees thi jise wo ghaseet rahe the. Sahaba ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, aap ne is ki kiya taabeer ki? Aap ne farmaya: Deen."
"2861","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main soya hua tha ke maine apne haath mein sone ke do kanghan dekhe; un ke muamle ne mujhe fikr mein daal diya; to khwab mein meri taraf wahi ki gayi ke inhein phoonk do; maine inhein phoonka to wo ur gaye; maine in ki taabeer do jhooton se ki jo mere baad niklenge: un mein se aik Ansi tha aur doosra Musailma."
"2862","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main soya hua tha ke maine khud ko jannat mein dekha; kiya dekhta hun ke aik aurat aik mahal ke pehlu mein wuzu kar rahi hai; maine kaha: Ye mahal kis ka hai? Unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Khattab ka hai; to mujhe tumhari ghairat yaad aayi aur main peeth pher kar laut aaya."
"2863","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ayyub nange ghusl kar rahe the ke un par sone ki tidiyan girne lageen; to Ayyub unhein apne kapre mein sametne lage; to un ke Rab tabarak wa taala ne unhein pukara: Ae Ayyub, kiya maine tumhein is se be-niyaaz nahi kar diya jo tum dekh rahe ho? Unhon ne kaha: Kyun nahi, aap ki izzat ki qasam, lekin main aap ki barkat se be-niyaaz nahi hun."
"2864","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aadmi zameen ke khule maidan mein tha ke us ne baadal mein aik aawaz suni jo kehti thi: Falan ki kheti ko paani de; to wo baadal hat gaya aur us ne apna paani pathrili zameen mein gira diya; kiya dekhta hai ke us pathrili zameen ki naliyon mein se aik nali ne wo saara paani apne andar le liya; to wo paani ke peeche chala; kiya dekhta hai ke aik aadmi apni kheti mein khara apne phawre se paani pher raha hai; us ne us se kaha: Ae Allah ke bande, tumhara naam kiya hai? Us ne wahi naam bataya jo us ne baadal mein suna tha; to us ne us se kaha: Ae Allah ke bande, tum ne mera naam kyun pucha? Us ne kaha: Maine us baadal mein jis ka ye paani hai aik aawaz suni jo kehti thi: Falan ki kheti ko paani de tumhare naam lekar; to tum is kheti mein kiya karte ho? Us ne kaha: Jab tum ne ye keh hi diya hai to suno: main dekhta hun ke is mein se jo nikalta hai us ka teesra hissa sadqa karta hun, teesra main aur mere ghar wale khate hain, aur teesra is mein wapas laga deta hun."
"2865","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main aik kunwein par tha us mein se paani nikaal raha tha ke Abu Bakr aur Umar aaye; Abu Bakr ne dol liya aur aik ya do dol nikaale aur un ke kheenchne mein kamzori thi, to Allah ne unhein bakhsh diya; phir Ibn Khattab ne Abu Bakr ke haath se dol le liya to wo un ke haath mein bara dol ban gaya; maine logon mein in jaisa koi tez kaam karne wala nahi dekha jo in ki tarah paani kheenche, yahan tak ke logon ne hauz par oont bitha diye."
"2866","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main Hateem mein leta hua tha ke mere paas aane wala aaya aur is jagah se is jagah tak ka hissa cheer diya aur mera dil nikaal liya; phir mere paas sone ka aik tasht laya gaya jo iman se bhara hua tha; mera dil Zamzam ke paani se dhoya gaya, phir bhar diya gaya, phir wapas rakh diya gaya; phir mere paas khachchar se chhoti aur gadhe se bari aik safaid sawari layi gayi jise Buraq kaha jata hai, wo apna qadam nazar ki inteha par rakhti thi; mujhe us par sawaar kiya gaya; phir Jibreel mujhe lekar chale yahan tak ke pehle aasmaan par aaye aur darwaza khulwaya; pucha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel; pucha gaya: Aap ke saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad; pucha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; pucha gaya: Unhein khush aamdeed, kitni achchi aamad hai; to darwaza khola gaya; phir jab main guzar gaya to wahan Adam the; unhon ne kaha: Ye tumhare walid Adam hain, unhein salam karo; maine unhein salam kiya aur unhon ne salam ka jawab diya, phir kaha: Naik Nabi aur naik bete ko khush aamdeed; phir mujhe dusre aasmaan tak le jaya gaya aur darwaza khulwaya gaya; pucha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel; pucha gaya: Aap ke saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad; pucha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; pucha gaya: Unhein khush aamdeed, kitni achchi aamad hai; to darwaza khola gaya; phir jab main guzar gaya to wahan Yahya aur Isa the aur wo donon khaala-zaad bhai hain; unhon ne kaha: Ye Yahya aur Isa hain, inhein salam karo; maine salam kiya to donon ne jawab diya, phir donon ne kaha: Naik bhai aur naik Nabi ko khush aamdeed; phir mujhe teesre aasmaan tak le jaya gaya aur darwaza khulwaya gaya; pucha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel; pucha gaya: Aap ke saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad; pucha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; pucha gaya: Unhein khush aamdeed, kitni achchi aamad hai; to darwaza khola gaya; phir jab main guzar gaya to wahan Yusuf the; unhon ne kaha: Ye Yusuf hain, inhein salam karo; maine unhein salam kiya to unhon ne jawab diya, phir kaha: Naik bhai aur naik Nabi ko khush aamdeed; phir mujhe chauthe aasmaan tak le jaya gaya aur darwaza khulwaya gaya; pucha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel; pucha gaya: Aap ke saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad; pucha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; pucha gaya: Unhein khush aamdeed, kitni achchi aamad hai; to darwaza khola gaya; phir jab main guzar gaya to wahan Idrees the; unhon ne kaha: Ye Idrees hain, inhein salam karo; maine salam kiya to unhon ne jawab diya, phir kaha: Naik bhai aur naik Nabi ko khush aamdeed; ¤ phir mujhe paanchwein aasmaan tak le jaya gaya aur darwaza khulwaya gaya; pucha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel; pucha gaya: Aap ke saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad; pucha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; pucha gaya: Unhein khush aamdeed, kitni achchi aamad hai; phir jab main guzar gaya to wahan Haroon the; unhon ne kaha: Ye Haroon hain, inhein salam karo; maine unhein salam kiya to unhon ne jawab diya, phir kaha: Naik bhai aur naik Nabi ko khush aamdeed; phir mujhe chhathe aasmaan tak le jaya gaya aur darwaza khulwaya gaya; pucha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel; pucha gaya: Aap ke saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad; pucha gaya: Kiya unhein bulaya gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; pucha gaya: Unhein khush aamdeed, kitni achchi aamad hai; phir jab main guzar gaya to wahan Musa the; unhon ne kaha: Ye Musa hain, inhein salam karo; maine unhein salam kiya to unhon ne jawab diya, phir kaha: Naik bhai aur naik Nabi ko khush aamdeed; phir jab main aage barha to wo rone lage; un se pucha gaya: Tumhein kiya rula raha hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main is liye ro raha hun ke aik naujawan jo mere baad mab'oos hua us ki ummat mein se jannat mein dakhil hone wale meri ummat mein se dakhil hone walon se zyada honge; phir mujhe saatwein aasmaan tak le jaya gaya aur darwaza khulwaya gaya; pucha gaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jibreel; pucha gaya: Aap ke saath kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Muhammad; pucha gaya: Kiya unhein bheja gaya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; pucha gaya: Unhein khush aamdeed, kitni achchi aamad hai; phir jab main guzar gaya to wahan Ibrahim the; unhon ne kaha: Ye tumhare walid Ibrahim hain, inhein salam karo; maine unhein salam kiya to unhon ne salam ka jawab diya aur kaha: Naik bete aur naik Nabi ko khush aamdeed; phir mere saamne Sidrat-ul-Muntaha buland ki gayi; kiya dekhta hun ke us ke ber Hajar ke matkon jaise hain aur us ke patte haathiyon ke kaanon jaise hain; unhon ne kaha: Ye Sidrat-ul-Muntaha hai; aur kiya dekhta hun ke chaar neherein hain, do andar aur do zahir; maine kaha: Ae Jibreel, ye donon kiya hain? Unhon ne kaha: Andar wali donon jannat ki neherein hain aur zahir wali donon Neel aur Furaat hain; phir mere saamne Bait-ul-Mamoor buland kiya gaya; maine kaha: Ae Jibreel, ye kiya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Bait-ul-Mamoor hai jis mein har din sattar hazaar farishte dakhil hote hain, jab us mein se nikalte hain to phir kabhi ¤ us ki taraf nahi laut-te, yehi un ka aakhri daur hota hai; phir mere paas sharaab ka aik bartan, doodh ka aik bartan aur shehad ka aik bartan laya gaya; maine doodh le liya; unhon ne kaha: Ye fitrat hai jis par tum ho aur tumhari ummat hai; phir mujh par har din pachaas namazein farz ki gayin; main wapas lauta aur Musa ke paas se guzra; unhon ne kaha: Tumhein kis ka hukm diya gaya? Maine kaha: Mujhe har din pachaas namazon ka hukm diya gaya hai; unhon ne kaha: Tumhari ummat har din pachaas namazon ki taaqat nahi rakhti; aur Allah ki qasam maine tum se pehle logon ko aazmaya hai aur bani Israel ka sakht ilaaj kiya hai; pas apne Rab ke paas wapas jao aur apni ummat ke liye takhfeef mango; main wapas gaya to mujh se dus kam kar di gayin; main Musa ke paas wapas aaya to unhon ne wahi kaha; main wapas gaya to mujh se dus kam kar di gayin; main Musa ke paas wapas aaya to unhon ne wahi kaha; main wapas gaya to mujh se dus kam kar di gayin; main Musa ke paas wapas aaya to unhon ne wahi kaha; main wapas gaya to mujh se dus kam kar di gayin; pas mujhe har din dus namazon ka hukm diya gaya; unhon ne wahi kaha; main wapas gaya to mujhe har din paanch namazon ka hukm diya gaya; main Musa ke paas wapas aaya; unhon ne kaha: Tumhein kis ka hukm diya gaya? Maine kaha: Mujhe har din paanch namazon ka hukm diya gaya hai; unhon ne kaha: Tumhari ummat har din paanch namazon ki taaqat nahi rakhti; aur maine tum se pehle logon ko aazmaya hai aur bani Israel ka sakht ilaaj kiya hai; pas apne Rab ke paas wapas jao aur apni ummat ke liye takhfeef mango; maine kaha: Maine apne Rab se itna manga ke mujhe sharam aa gayi, lekin main raazi hun aur sar jhukata hun; phir jab main aage barha to pukarne wale ne mujhe pukara: Maine apna farz naafiz kar diya aur apne bandon se takhfeef kar di."
"2867","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main soya hua tha ke aik giroh aaya; yahan tak ke jab maine unhein pehchan liya to mere aur un ke darmiyan se aik aadmi nikla aur kaha: Aao; maine kaha: Kahan? Us ne kaha: Aag ki taraf, Allah ki qasam; maine kaha: Un ka kiya haal hai? Us ne kaha: Unhon ne tumhare baad apni aidiyon par ulte qadam murtad ho gaye; phir aik aur giroh aaya; yahan tak ke jab maine unhein pehchan liya to mere aur un ke darmiyan se aik aadmi nikla aur kaha: Aao; maine kaha: Kahan? Us ne kaha: Aag ki taraf; maine kaha: Un ka kiya haal hai? Us ne kaha: Unhon ne tumhare baad apni aidiyon par ulte qadam murtad ho gaye; pas main nahi samajhta ke un mein se nijaat payenge magar maweshiyon mein haml na karne walon jitne."
"2868","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main soya hua tha ke maine khud ko Kaaba ka tawaf karte dekha; kiya dekhta hun ke aik saanwala aadmi seedhe baalon wala do aadmiyon ke darmiyan hai, us ke sar se paani tapak raha hai; maine kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ye Ibn Maryam hain; phir main mur kar dekhne laga to kiya dekhta hun ke aik surkh-rang bhaari-jism ghungrale sar wala kana aadmi hai goya us ki aankh ubhri hui angoor hai; maine kaha: Ye kaun hai? Unhon ne kaha: Dajjal hai; logon mein us se sab se zyada mushabeh Ibn Qatan hai."
"2869","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main soya hua tha ke maine khud ko aik chhote kunwein par dekha jis par dol tha; maine us mein se jitna Allah ne chaha nikala; phir use Ibn Abi Quhafa ne liya aur us se aik ya do dol nikaale aur un ke kheenchne mein kamzori thi, aur Allah un ki kamzori bakhsh de; phir wo bara dol ban gaya to use Ibn Khattab ne liya; maine logon mein Umar ki tarah kheenchne wala koi tez kaam karne wala nahi dekha; phir logon ne hauz par oont bitha diye."
"2870","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Teen aadmi chal rahe the ke unhein baarish ne aa liya to wo pahar ke aik ghaar mein panah-guzeen hue; pahar se aik chataan un ke ghaar ke munh par aa giri aur un par band ho gayi; to un mein se kisi ne doosre se kaha: Dekho tum ne Allah ke liye jo naik aamaal kiye hain un ke waseele se dua karo, shayad wo use tum se hata de; to un mein se aik ne kaha: Ae Allah, mere boodhe zaeef waldain the aur meri biwi thi aur mere chhote bachche the; main un par maweshi charta tha; phir jab shaam ko un par laut-ta to doodh dohta aur pehle apne waldain se shuru karta aur unhein apne bachchon se pehle pilata; aur aik din darakht mujhe door le gaye aur main shaam hone tak na aaya; maine unhein soya hua paya; maine jaisa dohta tha doha aur doodh ka bartan lekar un ke siron ke paas khara ho gaya; mujhe na unhein un ki neend se jagana pasand tha aur na bachchon ko un se pehle pilana, aur bachche mere qadmon ke paas ro rahe the; yehi mera aur un ka muamla raha yahan tak ke fajr tuloo ho gayi; pas agar tu jaanta hai ke maine ye teri raza ke liye kiya to hamare liye kushadgi farma jis se ham aasmaan dekhein; to Allah ne us mein se kushadgi farma di aur unhon ne us mein se aasmaan dekha; ¤ aur doosre ne kaha: Ae Allah, meri chacha-zaad behan thi jise main aurton se mardon ki sab se shadeed mohabbat se chahta tha; maine us se us ka nafs manga to us ne inkar kar diya yahan tak ke main us ke paas sau deenar laun; maine mehnat ki yahan tak ke sau deenar jama kar liye aur us ke paas le aaya; phir jab main us ki donon taangon ke darmiyan baitha to us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke bande, Allah se dar aur moher ko us ke haq ke siwa na khol; to main us se uth gaya; pas agar tu jaanta hai ke maine ye teri raza ke liye kiya to hamare liye us mein se kushadgi farma; to un ke liye kushadgi farma di gayi; aur teesre ne kaha: Ae Allah, maine aik mazdoor ko chawal ke aik faraq par mazdoori par rakha tha; phir jab us ne apna kaam poora kiya to mujh se kaha: Mujhe mera haq de; maine use us ka faraq pesh kiya to us ne use napasand kiya; main use bota raha yahan tak ke us mein se gaayen aur un ke charwahe jama kar liye; phir wo mere paas aaya aur kaha: Allah se dar aur mera haq na maar; maine kaha: Un gaayon aur un ke charwahon ke paas jao aur unhein le lo; us ne kaha: Allah se dar aur mera mazaq na ura; maine kaha: Main tumhara mazaq nahi ura raha, wo gaayen aur un ke charwahe le lo; to us ne unhein liya aur lekar chala gaya; pas agar tu jaanta hai ke maine ye teri raza ke liye kiya to jo baqi hai use khol de; to Allah ne jo baqi tha khol diya."
"2871","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aadmi gaay par sawaar tha ke wo us ki taraf mutawajjeh hui aur boli: Main is ke liye paida nahi ki gayi, main to kheti ke liye paida ki gayi hun; pas main is par iman rakhta hun, main aur Abu Bakr aur Umar; aur aik aadmi apni bakriyon mein tha ke bheriya daura aur un mein se aik bakri le gaya; us ne us ka peecha kiya yahan tak ke us se chhura liya; to bheriye ne us se kaha: Yahan tum ne use mujh se chhura liya, to darindon wale din us ka kaun hoga jis din mere siwa us ka koi charwaha nahi hoga; pas main is par iman rakhta hun, main aur Abu Bakr aur Umar."
"2872","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aadmi apna tehband takabbur se ghaseet raha tha ke use zameen mein dhansa diya gaya; pas wo qayamat ke din tak zameen mein dhans-ta chala jayega."
"2873","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aadmi raaste par chal raha tha ke use shadeed pyaas lagi ¤ to us ne aik kunwan paya aur us mein utra aur us mein se piya, phir nikla; kiya dekhta hai ke aik kutta haanp raha hai aur pyaas se mitti chaat raha hai; us ne kaha: Is kutte ko pyaas se wahi pahunchi hai jo mujhe pahunchi thi; to wo kunwein mein utra aur apna moza paani se bhar liya, phir use apne munh se pakra, phir upar charha aur kutte ko paani pilaya; to Allah ne us ka shukr ada kiya aur use bakhsh diya; har tar jigar wali jaan mein ajr hai."
"2874","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aadmi raaste par chal raha tha ke us ne raaste par kaante ki daali payi to use hata diya; to Allah ne us ka shukr ada kiya aur use bakhsh diya."
"2875","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik aadmi jora pehne chal raha tha, use apne aap par khushi thi, us ne apne baal sanware hue the ke Allah ne use zameen mein dhansa diya; pas wo qayamat ke din tak us mein dhans-ta chala jayega."
"2876","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik kutta chhote hauz ke gird ghoom raha tha ke pyaas use maarne wali thi ke use bani Israel ki badkaar aurton mein se aik badkaar ne dekha; us ne apna moza utara aur us se use paani pilaya to use bakhsh diya gaya."
"2877","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Samundar ka paani paak hai aur us ka murda halal hai."
"2878","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bakheel wo hai jis ke saamne mera zikr kiya jaye aur wo mujh par durood na bheje."
"2879","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Saadgi iman mein se hai."
"2880","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Neki achcha akhlaq hai aur gunah wo hai jo tumhare seene mein khatke aur tum napasand karo ke log us par mutla hon."
"2881","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Neki wo hai jis par nafs mutmain ho aur dil ko sukoon mile; aur gunah wo hai jis par nafs mutmain na ho aur dil ko sukoon na mile chahe fatwa dene wale tumhein fatwa dein."
"2882","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Barkat teen cheezon mein hai: jama'at mein, sareed mein aur sehri mein."
"2883","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Barkat ghoron ki peshaniyon mein hai."
"2884","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Barkat tumhare baron ke saath hai."
"2885","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Masjid mein thookna gunah hai aur use dafan karna neki hai."
"2886","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Masjid mein thookna khata hai aur us ka kaffara use dafan karna hai."
"2887","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Biz'a teen se nau tak hota hai."
"2888","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Pet ki bimari se aur doob kar marna shahadat hai."
"2889","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gaay saat ki taraf se aur oont saat ki taraf se hai."
"2890","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Gaay saat ki taraf se aur oont saat ki taraf se hai qurbaniyon mein."
"2891","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bait-ul-Mamoor saatwein aasmaan mein hai jis mein har din sattar hazaar farishte dakhil hote hain phir qayamat tak us ki taraf nahi laut-te."
"2892","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jab khareedne aur bechne wale sauda mein ikhtilaf karein to sauda wapas kar dein."
"2893","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bechne aur khareedne wale ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak wo juda na hon."
"2894","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bechne aur khareedne wale ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak wo juda na hon, magar ye ke ikhtiyar ka sauda ho; aur us ke liye halal nahi ke apne saathi se is darr se juda ho ke wo sauda wapas lene ko kahe."
"2895","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bechne aur khareedne wale ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak wo juda na hon ya un mein se aik apne saathi se kahe ke ikhtiyar kar lo."
"2896","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bechne aur khareedne wale ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak wo juda na hon; pas agar donon sach bolein aur wazeh karein to un ke sauda mein barkat rakhi jayegi; aur agar chhupayein aur jhoot bolein to un ke sauda ki barkat mita di jayegi."
"2897","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Daleel mudda'i par hai aur qasam mudda'alaih par."
"2898","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Daleel lao warna tumhari peeth par hadd lagegi."
